  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/fu_useBooze/text",
      "value": "The ^orange;Tavern^reset; provides entertainment and legal intoxicants to off-the-clock staff or visitors to the Science Outpost. While not all of us partake, some alcohol provides useful boons when ingested. After the ^orange;Tavern^reset; you'll find nothing of interest to investigate."
